  "notes": "The Library 2.0.1 keeps the compiled C# WPF private-archive redesign and fixes startup window sizing so the native Windows title bar, drag area, minimize, maximize, and close controls stay fully reachable on scaled or shorter displays. Existing cover data, stored panels, snapping, imports, wrap splitting, queues, backups, restore, archive controls, and independent updates are preserved. No separate runtime installation is required."
